    "team_labels": "TEAM_A / TEAM_B remain permutation-invariant appearance clusters; trajectory metrics do not depend on real-world team identity.",
    "camera_cut": "Camera cuts are modelled as an abrupt synthetic framing change plus explicit calibration refusal objects (failure_reason='camera_cut_uncalibrated'). Real broadcast cuts also change scene content, exposure and motion blur, which are not modelled: this scenario validates the refusal/recovery state machine, not real cut detection accuracy."
